{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-1","id":"msg_011CgQLm8BcsvBAStG5AlPRF","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking for a full design build plan for a food/recipe site workspace, laid out as 5 frames at 1440 width inside the workspace page. I set up my design system first: brand black #000000, tint #E7F9FD, ink #000, secondary text #6B7280-ish, border #E8E8ED, surface #F7F8F9, white, and favorite accent #E5484D. The type scale on Inter runs display 56/64 bold, h1 40/48, h2 32/40, h3 24/32, h4 20/28, body 16/26, small 14/22, caption 12/18. Radii are 12 for cards, 16 for buttons, 20 for images. The page grid is 1440 wide with content max 1280 and 80 margins.\n\nThe 5 frames are 01_Home, 02_Recipe, 03_Blog, 04_Blog_Post, and 05_Contact. For Home the required sections are header, categories, chef promo, featured recipe, footer, Instagram, more recipes, newsletter, and simple and tasty recipes. I check the arithmetic on the card grid: 4 cards at 304 wide plus 3 gaps at 20 give 1276, which fits the 1280 content width, so 4 columns work at 304 with 20 gap.\n\nI work in stages using one script per section and keep a compact helper preamble in each call since JS state does not persist across calls: helpers for hex-to-rgb conversion, solid fills, a text builder that sets font name, size, characters, line height as percent, letter spacing, alignment, and height auto-resize after resizing width, a frame builder that sets size, fill, corner radius, stroke plus weight, clipping, and optional auto-layout with gaps and padding, an image builder that uses imageHash with scaleMode FILL, and an icon builder that creates an instance and recolors vector fills and strokes.\n\nStage A goes in a library area at x=12000, y=0 on the workspace page, so all content stays inside 03 · Workspace. It holds the slider components: a 4-variant component set (Style=Primary or Secondary, State=Default or Hover) at 160x60 with r=16, 16 medium label, horizontal auto-layout with hug width and 36 padding, where Primary is black with white text, Secondary is white with a black border, and Hover uses #1F1F1F or #F5F5F5. The text field set has State=Default or Focused, a 14 medium label, a 420x60 input with r=14, border #E3E3EA, placeholder 15 regular #8A8A96, and Focused switches to a 1.5 black border. NavItem gets variants Current=true or false, with a 20x3 black underline under the current item. The RecipeCard set gets variants Favorited=Yes or No at 304 wide, vertical auto-layout with 12 gap, a 304x220 image at r=20 with clip, a 40x40 white circle at top-right holding a 24 heart, a title at 18/26 semibold, and a meta row of 18 timer and category icons. CategoryTile is a 132 tint circle with a 120 image inside and a 15 medium label below. The header and footer are built as instances across all 5 frames.\n\nFrame build order for Home is hero, categories, chef promo, more recipes, simple and tasty, Instagram, newsletter, footer, roughly 7000 tall. The Recipe page holds a centered title, a meta row of avatar, name, date, prep, cook, healthy, then intro, a large media image, two columns of directions plus an ingredients/nutrition/promo sidebar, 4 recommended cards, and a recipe list. Blog holds the intro \"Blog & Article\", a search bar, a sidebar, a 2x3 article grid, and pagination. Blog post holds a centered header, Q&A body with pull quote, a cooking-step photo, share row, and 4 recommended cards. Contact holds the \"Contact us\" heading, a form left, and a chef photo right.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"output_tokens":0,"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation_input_tokens":3522,"input_tokens":55,"cache_read_input_tokens":41476,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":3522}},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"4a1094b8-95cb-47b4-aa0a-0df7e190b320","uuid":"f90c4179-448d-40bc-a2fc-f1c280ad278c","timestamp":"2026-11-03T07:05:41.549Z","thinking_duration_ms":102641}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-1","id":"msg_011CgQLm8BcsvBAStG5AlPRF","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I have everything I need: image hashes, icon component IDs, fonts, and the default Button/Text Field specs. I'll build my design system and library components in the workspace first."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"output_tokens":0,"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation_input_tokens":3522,"input_tokens":55,"cache_read_input_tokens":41476,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":3522}},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"4a1094b8-95cb-47b4-aa0a-0df7e190b320","uuid":"30805048-5e3c-4934-8ab0-11974c0ebef5","timestamp":"2026-11-03T07:05:42.388Z"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-1","id":"msg_011CgQLm8BcsvBAStG5AlPRF","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01kob3T2Sq9JiErzRHIwqhpN","name":"mcp__figma__use_figma","input":{"code":"\nconst PG = await figma.getNodeByIdAsync('9:2');\nawait figma.setCurrentPageAsync(PG);\nfor (const s of ['Regular','Medium','Semi Bold','Bold']) await figma.loadFontAsync({family:'Inter',style:s});\nconst PAL={black:'#000000',ink:'#14141A',body:'#5B5B66',muted:'#8C8C99',line:'#EAEAF0',surface:'#F6F7F8',tint:'#E7F9FD',white:'#FFFFFF',fav:'#E5484D',teal:'#0B7C7C'};\nfunction hx(h){h=h.replace('#','');return {r:parseInt(h.slice(0,2),16)/255,g:parseInt(h.slice(2,4),16)/255,b:parseInt(h.slice(4,6),16)/255};}\nfunction solid(h,o){return {type:'SOLID',color:hx(h),opacity:o===undefined?1:o};}\nconst STY={r:'Regular',m:'Medium',sb:'Semi Bold',b:'Bold'};\nfunction T(p,o,chars){\n  const t=figma.createText();t.name=o.name||'Text';\n  t.fontName={family:'Inter',style:STY[o.st||'r']};\n  t.characters=chars!=null?chars:'Text';t.fontSize=o.sz||16;\n  t.lineHeight={unit:'PERCENT',value:(o.lh||1.45)*100};\n  if(o.ls!==undefined)t.letterSpacing={unit:'PERCENT',value:o.ls};\n  t.fills=[solid(o.c||PAL.ink)];t.textAlignHorizontal=o.al||'LEFT';\n  p.appendChild(t);\n  t.textAutoResize='HEIGHT';\n  t.resize(o.w||300,10);\n  if(o.x!==undefined)t.x=o.x; if(o.y!==undefined)t.y=o.y;\n  return t;\n}\nfunction F(p,o){\n  const f=figma.createFrame();f.name=o.name||'Frame';\n  f.resize(o.w||100,o.h||100);\n  f.fills=o.fill?[solid(o.fill)]:[];\n  if(o.r)f.cornerRadius=o.r;\n  if(o.stroke){f.strokes=[solid(o.stroke)];f.strokeWeight=o.sw||1;}\n  if(o.clip)f.clipsContent=true;\n  if(o.ef)f.effects=o.ef;\n  if(o.layout){\n    f.layoutMode=o.layout==='V'?'VERTICAL':'HORIZONTAL';\n    f.itemSpacing=o.gap||0;\n    const pd=o.pad||0;f.paddingTop=f.paddingBottom=f.paddingLeft=f.paddingRight=pd;\n    if(o.padL!==undefined)f.paddingLeft=o.padL;\n    f.primaryAxisSizingMode='AUTO';f.counterAxisSizingMode='FIXED';\n    if(o.align)f.counterAxisAlignItems=o.align;\n    if(o.main)f.primaryAxisAlignItems=o.main;\n    if(o.wrap)f.layoutWrap='WRAP';\n  }\n  p.appendChild(f);\n  if(o.x!==undefined)f.x=o.x; if(o.y!==undefined)f.y=o.y;\n  return f;\n}\nasync function iconInst(p,id,size,color){\n  const c=await figma.getNodeByIdAsync(id);const i=c.createInstance();p.appendChild(i);\n  i.rescale(size/24);\n  i.findAll(n=>n.type==='VECTOR').forEach(v=>{ if(v.fills.length)v.fills=[solid(color)]; if(v.strokes.length)v.strokes=[solid(color)]; });\n  return i;\n}\nasync function logoInst(p,id,x,y,w){\n  const c=await figma.getNodeByIdAsync(id);const i=c.createInstance();p.appendChild(i);\n  const ratio=i.height/i.width; i.rescale(w/i.width); i.x=x;i.y=y; return i;\n}\n// library root\nconst LIB=F(PG,{name:'Design Library · Foodieland',x:4000,y:0,w:2600,h:2400,fill:'#FFFFFF'});\nT(LIB,{name:'Library title',w:800,sz:32,st:'b',x:60,y:50},'Design Library · Foodieland');\nT(LIB,{name:'Library sub',w:900,sz:15,c:PAL.body,x:60,y:96},'Components used across the five screens. Instances live on 03 · Workspace screens.');\n\n// ---------- Button set ----------\nfunction mkBtn(style,state){\n  const c=figma.createComponent();c.name='Style='+style+', State='+state;\n  c.layoutMode='HORIZONTAL';c.counterAxisSizingMode='AUTO';c.primaryAxisSizingMode='AUTO';\n  c.paddingLeft=36;c.paddingRight=36;c.paddingTop=20;c.paddingBottom=20;\n  c.cornerRadius=16;c.itemSpacing=10;c.counterAxisAlignItems='CENTER';\n  c.fills=[solid(style==='Primary'?(state==='Hover'?'#262626':PAL.black):(state==='Hover'?PAL.surface:PAL.white))];\n  if(style==='Outline'){c.strokes=[solid(state==='Hover'?PAL.black:PAL.line)];c.strokeWeight=1.5;}\n  const t=figma.createText();t.fontName={family:'Inter',style:'Medium'};t.characters='Button';t.fontSize=16;t.lineHeight={unit:'PERCENT',value:120};\n  t.fills=[solid(style==='Primary'?PAL.white:PAL.ink)];c.appendChild(t);\n  return c;\n}\nconst btns=[mkBtn('Primary','Default'),mkBtn('Primary','Hover'),mkBtn('Outline','Default'),mkBtn('Outline','Hover')];\nconst btnSet=figma.combineAsVariants(btns,LIB);btnSet.name='UI / Button';btnSet.x=60;btnSet.y=170;\nT(LIB,{name:'lbl',w:300,sz:13,c:PAL.muted,x:60,y:150},'UI / Button — Primary + Outline, Default + Hover');\n\n// ---------- Text Field set ----------\nfunction mkField(state){\n  const c=figma.createComponent();c.name='State='+state;\n  c.layoutMode='VERTICAL';c.counterAxisSizingMode='FIXED';c.primaryAxisSizingMode='AUTO';c.resize(420,89);\n  c.itemSpacing=10;c.fills=[];c.counterAxisAlignItems='MIN';\n  const lbl=figma.createText();lbl.fontName={family:'Inter',style:'Medium'};lbl.characters='Label';lbl.fontSize=14;lbl.lineHeight={unit:'PERCENT',value:130};lbl.fills=[solid(PAL.ink)];c.appendChild(lbl);\n  const inp=figma.createFrame();inp.name='Input';inp.resize(420,60);inp.cornerRadius=14;inp.fills=[solid(state==='Focused'?PAL.white:(state==='Error'?'#FFF7F7':PAL.white))];\n  inp.strokes=[solid(state==='Focused'?PAL.black:(state==='Error'?PAL.fav:PAL.line))];inp.strokeWeight=state==='Default'?1:1.5;\n  inp.layoutMode='HORIZONTAL';inp.counterAxisSizingMode='FIXED';inp.primaryAxisSizingMode='FIXED';inp.paddingLeft=24;inp.paddingRight=24;inp.counterAxisAlignItems='CENTER';inp.fills=[solid(PAL.white)];\n  const ph=figma.createText();ph.name='Placeholder';ph.fontName={family:'Inter',style:'Regular'};ph.characters='Placeholder';ph.fontSize=15;ph.lineHeight={unit:'PERCENT',value:140};ph.fills=[solid(state==='Focused'?'#3A3A44':PAL.muted)];inp.appendChild(ph);\n  c.appendChild(inp);\n  inp.layoutAlign='STRETCH';\n  return c;\n}\nconst flds=[mkField('Default'),mkField('Focused'),mkField('Error')];\nconst fldSet=figma.combineAsVariants(flds,LIB);fldSet.name='UI / Text Field';fldSet.x=560;fldSet.y=170;\nT(LIB,{name:'lbl2',w:300,sz:13,c:PAL.muted,x:560,y:150},'UI / Text Field — Default, Focused, Error');\n\n// ---------- Nav item set ----------\nfunction mkNav(label,current){\n  const c=figma.createComponent();c.name='State='+(current?'Current':'Default');\n  c.layoutMode='VERTICAL';c.counterAxisSizingMode='AUTO';c.primaryAxisSizingMode='AUTO';c.itemSpacing=8;c.fills=[];c.counterAxisAlignItems='CENTER';\n  const t=figma.createText();t.fontName={family:'Inter',style:current?'Semi Bold':'Medium'};t.characters=label;t.fontSize=15;t.lineHeight={unit:'PERCENT',value:130};t.fills=[solid(current?PAL.black:PAL.body)];c.appendChild(t);\n  const bar=figma.createFrame();bar.name='Indicator';bar.resize(current?22:0,3);bar.cornerRadius=2;bar.fills=current?[solid(PAL.black)]:[];c.appendChild(bar);\n  return c;\n}\nconst n1=mkNav('Home',true),n2=mkNav('Home',false);\nconst navSet=figma.combineAsVariants([n1,n2],LIB);navSet.name='Navigation / Item';navSet.x=60;navSet.y=560;\n\n// ---------- Category tile ----------\nconst cats=[['Breakfast','7:8'],['Lunch','7:11'],['Meat','7:69'],['Vegan','7:60'],['Dessert','7:9'],['Chocolate','7:10']];\nconst tileComps=[];\nfor(const [nm,id] of cats){\n  const c=figma.createComponent();c.name='Name='+nm;c.resize(148,168);c.fills=[];c.layoutMode='VERTICAL';c.counterAxisSizingMode='FIXED';c.primaryAxisSizingMode='AUTO';c.itemSpacing=14;c.counterAxisAlignItems='CENTER';\n  const circ=figma.createFrame();circ.name='Disc';circ.resize(132,132);circ.cornerRadius=66;circ.fills=[solid(PAL.tint)];circ.clipsContent=false;circ.layoutMode='HORIZONTAL';circ.primaryAxisAlignItems='CENTER';circ.counterAxisAlignItems='CENTER';c.appendChild(circ);\n  const comp=await figma.getNodeByIdAsync(id);const inst=comp.createInstance();circ.appendChild(inst);inst.rescale(96/120);\n  const t=figma.createText();t.fontName={family:'Inter',style:'Medium'};t.characters=nm;t.fontSize=16;t.lineHeight={unit:'PERCENT',value:130};t.fills=[solid(PAL.ink)];c.appendChild(t);\n  tileComps.push(c);\n}\nconst tileSet=figma.combineAsVariants(tileComps,LIB);tileSet.name='Card / Category Tile';tileSet.x=60;tileSet.y=760;\n\nreturn {lib:LIB.id,btnSet:btnSet.id,btnPrimary:btns[0].id,btnPrimaryHover:btns[1].id,btnOutline:btns[2].id,btnOutlineHover:btns[3].id,\nfldSet:fldSet.id,fldDefault:flds[0].id,fldFocus:flds[1].id,fldError:flds[2].id,\nnavSet:navSet.id,navCurrent:n1.id,navDefault:n2.id,\ntileSet:tileSet.id,tiles:tileComps.map(c=>c.id)};\n","description":"Create design library: buttons, text fields, nav items, category tiles","fileKey":"KBfh4lzngcd72ozCVtDt2c"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"output_tokens":0,"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation_input_tokens":3522,"input_tokens":55,"cache_read_input_tokens":41476,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":3522}},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"4a1094b8-95cb-47b4-aa0a-0df7e190b320","uuid":"cbd14994-4eb9-4a96-be32-1da64a4e9075","timestamp":"2026-11-03T07:06:07.600Z","tool_use_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01kob3T2Sq9JiErzRHIwqhpN","display_name":"Use Figma","server_display_name":"figma-authenticated-proxy","tool_name":"use_figma"}]}
