de stepping by 326, newsletter and footer. I rebuild 05_Contact with H1 at 170, sub at 240, the 480x600 photo at x=80 y=330, a form at x=640 w=720 starting at y=300 with NAME, EMAIL ADDRESS, SUBJECT, ENQUIRY TYPE (640x60 with a chevron at x=600), a 640x140 MESSAGE, and a Submit instance (280x60), then 4 recommended cards, newsletter and footer.\n\nI treat inspection and both component fixes as independent of the rebuilds, and treat the three rebuilt screens as independent of each other, so they all belong in one response. Prototype reactions and screenshots depend on the frames existing, so they come after the rebuild verifies.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"output_tokens":0,"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation_input_tokens":9026,"input_tokens":55,"cache_read_input_tokens":206553,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":9026}},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"4a1094b8-95cb-47b4-aa0a-0df7e190b320","uuid":"b68df863-edfd-489c-9ed2-44b5b4439073","timestamp":"2026-11-03T07:30:40.705Z","thinking_duration_ms":74487}
