{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-1","id":"msg_011CgQPBeLuwXC0w1IgVBOLa","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Let me check the footer component's child geometry and fix what is mispositioned. The footer frame is 1440 wide at x=60 in the library, but the 01_Home footer content overflows: the tagline sits at the far left and the \"Foodieland.\" wordmark renders at the bottom-right, so the logo instance's x/y is wrong after the rescale. I set logo x=80, y=64 after `lg.rescale(180/lg.width)`, so I re-measure the children directly and reset them: logo at x=80, y=64, tagline at 80, 112, divider at 80, 196 with width 1280, copyright at 80, 232, and the 3 social icons right-aligned near x=1290 at y=234.\n\nThe 01_Home screenshot reports original_width 1470, so something extends 30px past the 1440 frame; I list children whose right edge exceeds 1440 to find it.\n\nThe 04_Blog_Post share row overlaps, so I set the icons at x=232+i*44 after the label's right edge.\n\nIn 02_Recipe the first ingredient label (\"2 cups cooked jasmine rice, chilled overnight\") wraps to 2 lines at 44px step and collides with the next row, so I space the ingredient instances by measured height plus 6 and shift the sauce block and Directions frame down.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"output_tokens":0,"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation_input_tokens":4733,"input_tokens":55,"cache_read_input_tokens":328111,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":4733}},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"4a1094b8-95cb-47b4-aa0a-0df7e190b320","uuid":"1cc43ac9-54d3-4efe-b28a-d2959992ecfa","timestamp":"2026-11-03T07:47:31.628Z","thinking_duration_ms":31169}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-1","id":"msg_011CgQPBeLuwXC0w1IgVBOLa","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Privately, here's what I still need: the footer's internal geometry (the wordmark is landing at the bottom-right and the tagline is pinned to the frame edge), the recipe ingredient rows (the first label wraps into the next row), the `04_Blog_Post` share row, and confirmation that the recommended cards on `04`/`05` carry reactions. The footer geometry is observable in the same pass I fix it, so footer, ingredients and share row go in one request now; the card check comes back as data from that same call."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"output_tokens":0,"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation_input_tokens":4733,"input_tokens":55,"cache_read_input_tokens":328111,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":4733}},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"4a1094b8-95cb-47b4-aa0a-0df7e190b320","uuid":"003266f0-b673-42ad-88e2-f8841e6ed409","timestamp":"2026-11-03T07:47:34.900Z"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-1","id":"msg_011CgQPBeLuwXC0w1IgVBOLa","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01BAlT0swfhlmaoDR9d3aRle","name":"mcp__figma__use_figma","input":{"code":"\nconst PG=await figma.getNodeByIdAsync('9:2');await figma.setCurrentPageAsync(PG);\nfor(const s of ['Regular','Medium','Semi Bold','Bold','Bold Italic','Italic']){try{await figma.loadFontAsync({family:'Inter',style:s});}catch(e){}}\nconst lib=PG.children.find(function(n){return n.name==='Design Library · Foodieland';});\nconst rep={};\n\n// ---------- 1. FOOTER GEOMETRY ----------\nconst foot=lib.children.find(function(c){return c.name==='Site / Footer';});\nfoot.resize(1440,300);\nfoot.clipsContent=true;\nconst kids=foot.children.map(function(c){return {n:c.name,t:c.type,x:Math.round(c.x),y:Math.round(c.y),w:Math.round(c.width),h:Math.round(c.height)};});\nrep.footerBefore=kids;\nconst logo=foot.children.find(function(c){return c.type==='INSTANCE'&&c.name.indexOf('Logo_Foodieland')===0;});\nif(logo){\n  if(Math.abs(logo.width-180)>1){logo.rescale(180/logo.width);}\n  logo.x=80;logo.y=62;\n}\nconst tag=foot.children.find(function(c){return c.name==='Tagline';});\nif(tag){tag.x=80;tag.y=112;tag.textAutoResize='WIDTH_AND_HEIGHT';}\nconst div=foot.children.find(function(c){return c.name==='Divider';});\nif(div){div.x=80;div.y=198;div.resize(1280,1);}\nconst cr=foot.children.find(function(c){return c.name==='Copyright';});\nif(cr){cr.x=80;cr.y=236;cr.textAutoResize='WIDTH_AND_HEIGHT';}\nconst links=foot.children.filter(function(c){return /^Link_/.test(c.name);});\nlinks.forEach(function(t){t.textAutoResize='WIDTH_AND_HEIGHT';});\nconst gap=36;\nlet tot=links.reduce(function(a,t){return a+t.width;},0)+gap*(links.length-1);\nlet lx=1360-tot;\nlinks.forEach(function(t){t.x=lx;t.y=74;lx+=t.width+gap;});\nconst socials=foot.children.filter(function(c){return c.type==='INSTANCE'&&c.name.indexOf('Logo_Foodieland')<0;});\nlet sx=1352-52;\nsocials.forEach(function(ic,i){ic.x=sx+i*26;ic.y=238;});\nrep.footerAfter=foot.children.map(function(c){return {n:c.name,x:Math.round(c.x),y:Math.round(c.y),w:Math.round(c.width),h:Math.round(c.height)};});\nrep.footerSocials=socials.map(function(s){return Math.round(s.x)+','+Math.round(s.y);});\n\n// ---------- 2. HOME OVERFLOW ----------\nconst home=PG.children.find(function(n){return n.name==='01_Home';});\nrep.homeOverflow=home.children.filter(function(c){return c.x+c.width>1440.5||c.x<-0.5;})\n  .map(function(c){return {n:c.name,x:Math.round(c.x),w:Math.round(c.width),right:Math.round(c.x+c.width)};});\nconst hfoot=home.children.find(function(c){return c.type==='INSTANCE'&&c.name==='Site / Footer';});\nrep.homeFooter=hfoot?{x:Math.round(hfoot.x),y:Math.round(hfoot.y),w:Math.round(hfoot.width),h:Math.round(hfoot.height)}:null;\n\n// ---------- 3. RECIPE INGREDIENTS REFLOW ----------\nconst rec=PG.children.find(function(n){return n.name==='02_Recipe';});\nconst left=rec.children.find(function(n){return n.name==='MainColumn';});\nif(left){\n  const ingr=left.children.filter(function(c){return c.type==='INSTANCE'&&c.name==='List / Ingredient';}).sort(function(a,b){return a.y-b.y;});\n  rep.ingBefore=ingr.map(function(i){return {y:Math.round(i.y),h:Math.round(i.height)};});\n  let y=102;\n  ingr.forEach(function(ins){\n    ins.y=y;\n    y+=Math.max(30,ins.height)+10;\n  });\n  const sauceTitle=left.children.find(function(c){return c.name==='SauceTxt';});\n  if(sauceTitle){sauceTitle.y=y+18;}\n  const dirFrame=left.children.find(function(c){return c.name==='Directions';});\n  if(dirFrame){dirFrame.y=y+92;}\n  const oldLeftH=left.height;\n  const newLeftH=dirFrame?dirFrame.y+dirFrame.height:oldLeftH;\n  left.resize(760,newLeftH);\n  rep.leftH={before:oldLeftH,after:newLeftH,dirY:dirFrame?Math.round(dirFrame.y):null};\n  // reflow sections\n  const right=rec.children.find(function(n){return n.name==='Sidebar';});\n  const CY=left.y;\n  const bottom=Math.max(CY+left.height,CY+right.height);\n  const RY=bottom+110;\n  const reco=rec.children.find(function(n){return n.name==='Recommended';});\n  if(reco){reco.y=RY;}\n  const newsInst=rec.children.filter(function(n){return n.type==='INSTANCE'&&n.name==='Section / Newsletter';})[0];\n  const footInst=rec.children.filter(function(n){return n.type==='INSTANCE'&&n.name==='Site / Footer';})[0];\n  if(newsInst){newsInst.y=RY+560;}\n  if(footInst){footInst.y=RY+980;}\n  rec.resize(1440,RY+1280);\n  rep.recH=rec.height;\n}\n\n// ---------- 4. POST SHARE ROW ----------\nconst post=PG.children.find(function(n){return n.name==='04_Blog_Post';});\nif(post){\n  const shRow=post.children.find(function(n){return n.name==='Share';});\n  if(shRow){\n    const lbl=shRow.children.find(function(c){return c.name==='lbl';});\n    if(lbl){lbl.textAutoResize='WIDTH_AND_HEIGHT';lbl.x=0;lbl.y=22;}\n    const icons=shRow.children.filter(function(c){return c.type==='INSTANCE';}).sort(function(a,b){return a.x-b.x;});\n    const start=(lbl?lbl.width:200)+40;\n    icons.forEach(function(ic,i){ic.x=start+i*44;ic.y=20;});\n    // bottom border\n    const line=figma.createRectangle();line.name='Rule';line.resize(760,1);\n    line.fills=[{type:'SOLID',color:{r:0.918,g:0.918,b:0.941}}];shRow.appendChild(line);line.x=0;line.y=59;\n    rep.share=icons.map(function(i){return Math.round(i.x)+','+Math.round(i.y);});\n  }\n}\n\n// ---------- 5. CARD REACTION AUDIT ----------\nfunction sum(r){if(!r||!r.length){return null;}return r.map(function(x){const a=(x.actions||[])[0]||{};return (a.destinationId||'none');});}\nrep.cards={};\n['04_Blog_Post','05_Contact','02_Recipe'].forEach(function(nm){\n  const f=PG.children.find(function(n){return n.name===nm;});\n  rep.cards[nm]=f.findAll(function(n){return n.type==='INSTANCE'&&n.name.indexOf('Card / Recipe')===0;})\n    .map(function(n){return {x:Math.round(n.x),y:Math.round(n.y),to:sum(n.reactions)};});\n});\nreturn rep;\n","description":"Fix footer geometry, recipe ingredient spacing, post share row; audit cards","fileKey":"KBfh4lzngcd72ozCVtDt2c"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"output_tokens":0,"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation_input_tokens":4733,"input_tokens":55,"cache_read_input_tokens":328111,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":4733}},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"4a1094b8-95cb-47b4-aa0a-0df7e190b320","uuid":"0eb5b44d-1603-475e-8107-4eecf059cfdf","timestamp":"2026-11-03T07:47:49.495Z","tool_use_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01BAlT0swfhlmaoDR9d3aRle","display_name":"Use Figma","server_display_name":"figma-authenticated-proxy","tool_name":"use_figma"}]}
