{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-1","id":"msg_011CgQPOPD18mantYr2EjX3q","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking for a private list of what I need next, then everything independent in one response. I need to fix the ingredient component so labels align: text sits at y=-3 in a 20x20 box with auto height, since text inside an instance cannot take a y value. Then I reflow the recipe rows by measuring label heights (2-line labels reach about 44), and take the recipe screenshot after.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"output_tokens":0,"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation_input_tokens":3590,"input_tokens":55,"cache_read_input_tokens":346820,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":3590}},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"4a1094b8-95cb-47b4-aa0a-0df7e190b320","uuid":"c540b8e1-cdca-4101-9c55-6366dddaf091","timestamp":"2026-11-03T07:49:47.336Z","narration_block_indexes":[0],"thinking_duration_ms":9952}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-1","id":"msg_011CgQPOPD18mantYr2EjX3q","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Privately, what I need next:\n\n- Fix the Ingredient row: I cannot reposition a text child inside an instance, so the alignment must be baked into the component, then instance heights set only at the frame level.\n- Reflow the recipe ingredient list after that component change.\n- Re-verify `02_Recipe` (only open issue left; Home footer now renders correctly).\n- Final report.\n\nThe component fix gates everything else, so it goes alone in this response."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"output_tokens":0,"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation_input_tokens":3590,"input_tokens":55,"cache_read_input_tokens":346820,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":3590}},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"4a1094b8-95cb-47b4-aa0a-0df7e190b320","uuid":"80a52390-3062-4dd4-bb5c-28b5cfac7dbe","timestamp":"2026-11-03T07:49:52.436Z"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-1","id":"msg_011CgQPOPD18mantYr2EjX3q","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_019jqKoabqxk0eAjJ6w15Auc","name":"mcp__figma__use_figma","input":{"code":"\nconst PG=await figma.getNodeByIdAsync('9:2');await figma.setCurrentPageAsync(PG);\nfor(const s of ['Regular','Medium','Semi Bold','Bold']){await figma.loadFontAsync({family:'Inter',style:s});}\nconst lib=PG.children.find(function(n){return n.name==='Design Library · Foodieland';});\nconst ingSet=lib.children.find(function(c){return c.name==='List / Ingredient';});\nconst rep={variants:[]};\ningSet.children.forEach(function(v){\n  const box=v.children.find(function(c){return c.name==='Box';});\n  const txt=v.children.find(function(c){return c.type==='TEXT';});\n  if(txt){\n    txt.textAutoResize='NONE';\n    txt.resize(304,10);\n    txt.textAutoResize='HEIGHT';\n    txt.fontSize=15;txt.lineHeight={unit:'PERCENT',value:150};\n  }\n  const th=txt?txt.height:20;\n  const h=Math.max(24,th+4);\n  v.resize(340,h);\n  if(box){box.resize(20,20);box.cornerRadius=5;box.x=0;box.y=2;}\n  if(txt){txt.x=32;txt.y=2;}\n  rep.variants.push({n:v.name,h:h,txtH:Math.round(th)});\n});\nreturn rep;\n","description":"Fix ingredient component label sizing","fileKey":"KBfh4lzngcd72ozCVtDt2c"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"output_tokens":0,"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation_input_tokens":3590,"input_tokens":55,"cache_read_input_tokens":346820,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":3590}},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"4a1094b8-95cb-47b4-aa0a-0df7e190b320","uuid":"488f3188-7e27-484f-bdff-f874de9e8012","timestamp":"2026-11-03T07:49:52.487Z","tool_use_meta":[{"id":"toolu_019jqKoabqxk0eAjJ6w15Auc","display_name":"Use Figma","server_display_name":"figma-authenticated-proxy","tool_name":"use_figma"}]}
