{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-1","id":"msg_011CgQPVEiF2Bg5Gc04e42tq","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking for a private list of what I need next, then for every item that doesn't depend on another's result to be requested in this same response. The audit surfaced several issues. The nav \"current\" check looked for an indicator with width>0, but every item reports [current], so I need to inspect each frame's actual indicator widths and bold/underline state and fix the wrong ones. The missing card links on 04_Blog_Post and 05_Contact may be false negatives: the audit searched for names prefixed 'RecipeCard_', while the recommended cards are named \"Card / Recipe\", so I check both names and add links where genuinely absent. The footer social icons at x=1300..1374 exceed the 1360 edge, so I realign them. The nav inspection, the card-link check and the footer fix are independent, so I request all three now; screenshots wait on these edits.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"output_tokens":0,"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation_input_tokens":3111,"input_tokens":55,"cache_read_input_tokens":353857,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":3111}},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"4a1094b8-95cb-47b4-aa0a-0df7e190b320","uuid":"e63f4650-6046-41e5-a3a3-62a55ba5f2c2","timestamp":"2026-11-03T07:51:16.794Z","thinking_duration_ms":17918}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-1","id":"msg_011CgQPVEiF2Bg5Gc04e42tq","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**Privately, what I need next:**\n\n- The nav audit reported every item as current, so my current-state check is wrong and needs inspection of the actual underline/weight per frame.\n- The `04_Blog_Post` and `05_Contact` recommended fried-rice cards may already be linked but sit under the default instance name `Card / Recipe`, which my audit skipped — needs a check by that name, and a link if missing.\n- Footer social icons end at 1374, past the 1360 content edge.\n- Then final screenshots of Home and Blog Post.\n\nThe nav inspection, link audit and footer nudge are independent of each other, so all three go in this one call."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"output_tokens":0,"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation_input_tokens":3111,"input_tokens":55,"cache_read_input_tokens":353857,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":3111}},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"4a1094b8-95cb-47b4-aa0a-0df7e190b320","uuid":"5ba9d045-8a56-4e62-80b4-d2351618bb96","timestamp":"2026-11-03T07:51:21.293Z"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-1","id":"msg_011CgQPVEiF2Bg5Gc04e42tq","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01b2H3KB0rbf04THwrCcdFTB","name":"mcp__figma__use_figma","input":{"code":"\nconst PG=await figma.getNodeByIdAsync('9:2');await figma.setCurrentPageAsync(PG);\nfor(const s of ['Regular','Medium','Semi Bold','Bold']){await figma.loadFontAsync({family:'Inter',style:s});}\nconst rep={nav:{},cards:{},footer:null};\n\n// ---- 1. nav current state per frame ----\n['01_Home','02_Recipe','03_Blog','04_Blog_Post','05_Contact'].forEach(function(nm){\n  const f=PG.children.find(function(n){return n.name===nm;});\n  if(!f){return;}\n  const hdr=f.children.find(function(c){return c.name==='Site / Header';});\n  if(!hdr){rep.nav[nm]='noheader';return;}\n  const items=hdr.findAll(function(n){return n.type==='INSTANCE'&&/^Nav_/.test(n.name);});\n  rep.nav[nm]=items.map(function(n){\n    const t=n.findOne(function(y){return y.type==='TEXT';});\n    const ind=n.findOne(function(y){return y.name==='Indicator';});\n    return (t?t.characters:'?')+'|'+t.fontName.style+'|bar'+(ind?Math.round(ind.width):'-');\n  });\n});\n\n// ---- 2. audit ALL card instances (both naming schemes) ----\nfunction sum(r){if(!r||!r.length){return null;}return r.map(function(x){const a=(x.actions||[])[0]||{};return a.destinationId||'none';});}\nfunction titleOf(inst){const t=inst.findOne(function(n){return n.name==='Title';});return t?t.characters:'(none)';}\n['02_Recipe','04_Blog_Post','05_Contact'].forEach(function(nm){\n  const f=PG.children.find(function(n){return n.name===nm;});\n  const cards=f.findAll(function(n){return n.type==='INSTANCE'&&(n.name.indexOf('Card / Recipe')===0||n.name.indexOf('RecipeCard_')===0);});\n  rep.cards[nm]=cards.map(function(c){return {x:Math.round(c.x),y:Math.round(c.y),t:titleOf(c).slice(0,28),to:sum(c.reactions)};});\n});\n\n// ---- 3. link recommended fried-rice cards on 04 and 05 if missing ----\nconst recipeId='37:1033';\nconst fixes={};\n['04_Blog_Post','05_Contact'].forEach(function(nm){\n  const f=PG.children.find(function(n){return n.name===nm;});\n  const cards=f.findAll(function(n){return n.type==='INSTANCE'&&(n.name.indexOf('Card / Recipe')===0||n.name.indexOf('RecipeCard_')===0);});\n  cards.forEach(function(c){\n    if(titleOf(c)==='Healthy Japanese Fried Rice with Asparagus'){\n      if(!c.reactions||!c.reactions.length){\n        try{\n          c.reactions=[{trigger:{type:'ON_CLICK'},actions:[{type:'NODE',destinationId:recipeId,navigation:'NAVIGATE',transition:null,preserveScrollPosition:false}]}];\n          fixes[nm+'@'+Math.round(c.y)]='linked';\n        }catch(e){fixes[nm+'@'+Math.round(c.y)]='err:'+e.message.slice(0,60);}\n      } else fixes[nm+'@'+Math.round(c.y)]='already';\n    }\n  });\n});\nrep.fixes=fixes;\n\n// ---- 4. footer socials within 1360 ----\nconst lib=PG.children.find(function(n){return n.name==='Design Library · Foodieland';});\nconst foot=lib.children.find(function(c){return c.name==='Site / Footer';});\nconst socials=foot.children.filter(function(c){return c.type==='INSTANCE'&&c.name.indexOf('Logo_Foodieland')<0;});\nconst startX=1356-70;\nsocials.forEach(function(ic,i){ic.x=startX+i*25;ic.y=236;});\nrep.footer=socials.map(function(s){return Math.round(s.x)+'-'+Math.round(s.x+s.width);});\nreturn rep;\n","description":"Audit nav current states, card links; fix footer socials","fileKey":"KBfh4lzngcd72ozCVtDt2c"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"output_tokens":0,"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation_input_tokens":3111,"input_tokens":55,"cache_read_input_tokens":353857,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":3111}},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"4a1094b8-95cb-47b4-aa0a-0df7e190b320","uuid":"46f559b6-30ad-4221-a2f7-6ee9bb4a2165","timestamp":"2026-11-03T07:51:29.565Z","tool_use_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01b2H3KB0rbf04THwrCcdFTB","display_name":"Use Figma","server_display_name":"figma-authenticated-proxy","tool_name":"use_figma"}]}
